### Anonymous protected request — expected 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets
Accept: application/json

### CSRF bootstrap — public, expected 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

### Current user — expected 401 while anonymous, 200 after sign-in
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

